  "notes": "CDS transport_socket accepts one inline UpstreamTlsContext with optional SNI, inline trusted_ca and one inline client certificate/key. EDS, STATIC and DNS endpoints use TLS targets; EDS/STATIC project through the existing priority/locality runtime, DNS builds tls_host endpoints. The end-to-end test performs a certificate-verified RPC through a STATIC cluster using the inline CA. SDS, providers, tls_params, SAN matching and file/environment data sources are rejected."
